<reference id="kitControl-ArcTangent2" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">kitControl-ArcTangent2</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component  accepts two inputs, in In A and in In B, and returns the angle θ (theta) from the conversion of rectangular coordinates (x,y) to polar coordinates (r,θ).</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Claudia Serwe &lt;claudia.serwe@tridium.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "/></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
