    <p class="- topic/p ">The ArcTangent2 is available in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Math</uicontrol> folder of the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">kitControl</apiname> palette.</p>
